icId":"cne_j034","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"在商店想问蛋糕的价格，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"How many is the cake?"},{"key":"B","text":"What much is the cake?"},{"key":"C","text":"How much the cake is?"},{"key":"D","text":"How much is the cake?"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"单数物品用 How much is。","verify":"\"How much is the cake?\""},{"id":"cne_j034_q2","topicId":"cne_j034","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"店员说 It is 20 dollars. 你决定买下，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I'll take it."},{"key":"B","text":"I take them are."},{"key":"C","text":"I'll taking it."},{"key":"D","text":"I am take it."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"I'll take it 表示我买下它。","verify":"\"I'll take it.\""},{"id":"cne_j034_q3","topicId":"cne_j034","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"想要一些气球，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I want a balloons."},{"key":"B","text":"I want some balloons."},{"key":"C","text":"I want some balloones."},{"key":"D","text":"I wants some balloons."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"some 加复数 balloons。","verify":"\"I want some balloons.\""},{"id":"cne_j034_q4","topicId":"cne_j034","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Can I help you? 店员这句是在做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"询问你的生日"},{"key":"B","text":"说蛋糕很贵"},{"key":"C","text":"询问你需要什么帮助"},{"key":"D","text":"介绍自己的家人"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"Can I help you 是商店里的招呼。","verify":"\"询问你需要什么帮助\""},{"id":"cne_j035_q1","topicId":"cne_j035","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Girl: How much is this cake? Clerk: It is 20 dollars. Girl: I'll take it. 蛋糕多少钱？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"20 美元"},{"key":"B","text":"6 美元"},{"key":"C","text":"15 美元"},{"key":"D","text":"8 美元"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"It is 20 dollars。","verify":"\"20 美元\""},{"id":"cne_j035_q2","topicId":"cne_j035","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Girl: How much is this cake? Clerk: It is 20 dollars. Girl: I'll take it. 她买了吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"没买"},{"key":"B","text":"买了"},