xt":"It is in September 5."},{"key":"C","text":"It is on September five."},{"key":"D","text":"It are on September 5th."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"具体日子用 on 加序数词。","verify":"\"It is on September 5th.\""},{"id":"cne_j038_q3","topicId":"cne_j038","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"How old are you? 这句在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"你的生日是哪天"},{"key":"B","text":"你多大"},{"key":"C","text":"你叫什么"},{"key":"D","text":"你来自哪里"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"How old 问年龄。","verify":"\"你多大\""},{"id":"cne_j038_q4","topicId":"cne_j038","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"想说 Alice 十二岁，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Alice are twelve."},{"key":"B","text":"Alice is twelfth."},{"key":"C","text":"Alice is twelve."},{"key":"D","text":"Alice has twelve."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"年龄用基数词 twelve，不是序数词 twelfth。","verify":"\"Alice is twelve.\""},{"id":"cne_j039_q1","topicId":"cne_j039","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Tom's birthday is on September 21st. His party is on that day. The family dinner is on October 2nd. Tom 的生日是哪一天？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"9 月 21 日"},{"key":"B","text":"10 月 2 日"},{"key":"C","text":"9 月 2 日"},{"key":"D","text":"10 月 21 日"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"September 21st 是 9 月 21 日。","verify":"\"9 月 21 日\""},{"id":"cne_j039_q2","topicId":"cne_j039","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Tom's birthday is on September 21st. His party is on that day. The family dinner is on October 2nd. 家庭晚餐在哪一天？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"9 月 21 日"},{"key":"B","text":"10 月 2 日"},{"key":"C","text":"10 月 21 日"},{"key":"D","text":"11 月 2 日"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"October 2nd 是 10 月 2 日。","verify":"\"10 月 2 日\""},{"id":"cne_j039_q3","topicId":"cne_j039","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Tom's birthday is on September 21st. His party is on that day. The family dinner is on October 2nd. 聚会和生日是不是同一天？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"不是"},{"key":"B","text":"聚会在十月"},{"key":"C","text":"是"},{"key":"D","text":"短文没说聚会"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"His party is on that day，that day 指生日。","verify":"\"是\""},{"id":"cne_j039_q4","topicId":"cne_j039","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Tom's birthday is on September 21st. His party is on that day. The family dinner is on October 2nd. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"The dinner is on September 21st."},{"key":"B","text":"Tom's birthday is on October 2nd."},{"key":"C","text":"There is no party."},{"key":"D","text":"The party is on September 21st."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"聚会在生日当天，也就是 9 月 21 日。","verify":"\"The party is on September 21st.\""}]
